            crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Eel (Anguilla anguilla), a freshwater/migratory fish widely traded salted and fresh. Recorded in several named sizes and preparations given their own entries: see stub eel, shaft eel, middle eel, pympernel and kyve eel." ;
